.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil 1  "xil 1.0.0" 
.SH NAME
xil \- Unified command\-line interface for the xil podcast pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIcommand\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Usage: xil <command> [args...]
.PP
Pipeline Stages (recommended order):
  init                        workspace scaffolding
  scan               XILP000  pre\-flight script scanner
  parse              XILP001  script parser
  cues               XILP006  cues sheet ingestion
  produce            XILP002  voice stem generation
  assemble           XILP003  master audio assembly
  studio\-onboard     XILP004  ElevenLabs Studio project onboarding
  daw                XILP005  DAW layer export
  migrate            XILP007  stem migration
  cleanup            XILP008  stale stem cleanup
  import             XILP010  Studio export import
  regen              XILP009  script regeneration
  master             XILP011  final master MP3 export
  publish            XILP012  social media post draft generator
.PP
Utilities:
  use                         set / show the active show context  (multi\-show workspaces)
  voices             XILU001  voice discovery  (before parse/produce)
  csv\-join           XILU003  CSV + SFX/cast annotation join  (after parse)
  sfx                XILU002  standalone SFX generation  (after cues/parse)
  sample             XILU004  voice sample generation  (after voices/cast config)
  sfx\-lib            XILU005  SFX library discovery  (any time)
  splice             XILU006  parsed JSON splice utility  (advanced)
  mp3\-hash           XILU007  recursive MP3 SHA\-256 hash log  (integrity / audit)
  stem\-log           XILU008  parse daily logs → chronological stem generation CSV  (integrity / audit)
  gui                         web dashboard (requires [gui] extra)  (pip install xil\-pipeline[gui])
  migrate\-workspace  XILU009  migrate pre\-0.1.8 workspace to normalized layout  (run once per workspace)
  db\-profile         XILU010  profile MP3 loudness: peak, average, and minimum dBFS  (audio level analysis)
  sfx\-csv            XILU011  flatten sfx_<tag>.json configs to CSV — one row per effect  (debug / audit)
  parsed\-csv         XILU012  export parsed_<tag>.json entries to CSV — one row per entry  (debug / audit)
  sfx\-hydrate        XILU013  write pipe\-hint source fields from parsed JSON into the SFX config  (after parse, before produce)
  sfx\-restore        XILU020  reapply journaled timeline sound edits onto the SFX config  (recover timeline sound edits)
  sfx\-impact         XILU021  report which source\-backed cues duration_seconds is clipping short  (before changing clip durations)
  sfx\-match          XILU022  find existing library assets for cues whose source file is missing  (when produce reports missing SFX sources)
  episode\-summary    XILU014  write one\-row\-per\-episode summary CSV (lines, words, TTS chars)  (any time)
  stem\-verify        XILU015  scan stems folder → JSON report with file attributes and optional Whisper transcripts  (after produce / import)
  stem\-compare       XILU016  cross\-reference a stem\-verify transcript report against the parsed script  (after stem\-verify)
  remove\-show        XILU017  remove all workspace files for a show (\-\-dry\-run safe)  (workspace management)
  remove\-episode     XILU018  remove workspace files for one episode, preserving the source script (\-\-dry\-run safe)  (workspace management)
  status             XILU019  make\-style staleness check of an episode\*(Aqs pipeline artifacts (report only)  (workspace management)
.PP
Run \*(Aqxil <command> \-\-help\*(Aq for command\-specific options.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
